<view class="about-page">
  <page-navigation show-home="{{false}}" />
  <text class="about-page__title">关于 Root</text>

  <view class="about-page__wordmark"><root-wordmark /></view>
  <text class="about-page__introduction">Root 从理解身体开始。
我们关注身体、心智与能量如何重新步入节奏，
并把真实、持续的健康选择带回日常。</text>

  <view class="about-page__quote">
    <text>人如草木，根定而生。
把身体还给身体自己。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="about-page__links">
    <view class="about-page__row" bindtap="openPhggReference"><text>ROOT 核心原料 PHGG 科学参考文献集</text><view class="about-page__arrow"></view></view>
    <view class="about-page__row" data-type="agreement" bindtap="openLegal"><text>用户协议</text><view class="about-page__arrow"></view></view>
    <view class="about-page__row" data-type="privacy" bindtap="openLegal"><text>隐私政策</text><view class="about-page__arrow"></view></view>
    <view class="about-page__row" bindtap="openPrivacyAccount"><text>隐私与账号</text><view class="about-page__arrow"></view></view>
    <view class="about-page__row" data-type="sharing" bindtap="openLegal"><text>第三方信息共享清单</text><view class="about-page__arrow"></view></view>
  </view>

  <text class="about-page__version">myRoot v{{version}}</text>
  <text class="about-page__copyright">Root Member Club</text>
</view>
